# Original HTML reader preference availability.
original-html-settings-title = Original message HTML
original-html-settings-help = Keep the sender’s original formatting when the standard view changes the message layout.
original-html-settings-loading = Checking whether Original HTML is available for this account.
original-html-settings-feature-off = Original HTML is disabled in this account’s feature profile. Ask your administrator to enable Original HTML view.
original-html-settings-capability-off = Your administrator has disabled the Original HTML capability for this account.
original-html-settings-strict = Your administrator requires strict HTML handling, so Original HTML is unavailable.
original-html-settings-use = After enabling this option, open a message and choose Show Original HTML. Plain-text-only reading remains unchanged.
